    {
      "id": "1ED63F4805934997",
      "title": "First rotation",
      "icon": "create:water_wheel",
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "size": 1.15,
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "description": [
        "&6Turn motion into useful work.&r",
        "",
        "Build a Water Wheel or Windmill Bearing, then carry its rotation through shafts and cogwheels to a Mechanical Press.",
        "",
        "Use Create's Ponder scenes to inspect unfamiliar blocks. Wear Engineer's Goggles and watch the stress readout before adding more machines.",
        "",
        "",
        "&eItem requirement:&r Carry the listed items in your inventory while this quest is unlocked. Items are detected and kept; placed blocks must be picked up for detection.",
        "The build instructions above are practical goals; inventory detection does not verify a shelter, chunk claim, running machine, or train schedule.",
        "",
        "Rewards: one random Create supply bundle, plus the listed XP. Common supplies have higher odds; each reward can be claimed once."
      ],
