      "x": 6.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "description": [
        "Build a sequenced assembly line for Precision Mechanisms and power a Deployer from the same workshop.",
        "",
        "Use JEI to confirm every assembly step. Give the incomplete mechanism a return path, but stop the belt when its output storage is full.",
