    {
      "id": "6A19120000000601",
      "title": "A reliable factory",
      "icon": "create:brass_casing",
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "size": 1.25,
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 3.0,
      "description": [
        "&6Bring the workshop together.&r",
        "",
        "Connect one renewable input, a multi-step processing line, safe power, and organized output storage. Label emergency stops and leave maintenance access around moving parts.",
        "",
        "Let the factory run long enough to fill an output buffer. Confirm that full storage stops or diverts production without spilling items into the world.",
        "",
